WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:02.930
It was windy.

00:03.050 --> 00:07.000
That tells us. But what did the wind do?

00:07.120 --> 00:13.790
Personification gives a thing feelings or actions that only people have.

00:13.910 --> 00:17.500
The wind grabbed my hat and ran off with it.

00:17.620 --> 00:20.390
Now you can almost see it run!

00:20.510 --> 00:25.450
Here is one more. The old stairs groaned under my feet.

00:25.570 --> 00:32.000
So look for a thing doing something people do, and try one in your own writing!
